{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Maps recipe ingredients to the portion norms in portion-norms.json. Lookup order, first match wins: (1) canonical id (directory.json idMap[id] ?? id) in `ids`; (2) exact vocabulary name or alias of an id in `ids`; (3) any other known vocabulary id: no category (spices, oils, sauces never drive servings); (4) `deny` on the name or id: no category; (5) `keywords` in order on the name or id. `refine` corrects a category resolved from a plain id when the name says more (\"لحم بقري مفروم\" with id beef is mince, \"لحم غنم شقف\" is bone-in): pattern on the name, new category, the categories it may replace. `pieceWeights` give the weight of one piece by name or id where the norm's piece weight is wrong (a whole cabbage). `nameOverrides` replace a vocabulary alias whose portion differs (the vocabulary files minced meat under beef). `rawOverrides` set a recipe-local id directly and win over idMap (the directory maps \"meat\" to chicken). `kinds` turns the recipe category into a dish kind, first match wins; `priority` lists the roles that can drive each kind.",
